{"id":132552829970998,"name":"Prime Craftwars","desc":"[Disclaimer: The game is currently under development! Bugs/feedback can be reported using the game's Social Links.]\n\nWelcome to Prime Craftwars!\n\nPrime Craftwars is a spiritual successor to Exotic Craftwars.! Mine and fight your way through numerous different bosses and incrementally upgraded tiers of equipment in a line of progression that extends beyond the traditional end seen in other Craftwars games. Prove yourself strong enough to face forces outside the bounds of reality and far past the reaches of the mind!\n\nPlease consider supporting the game by liking and favoriting it, you'll help keep us motivated to continue working on the game!","path":"/game/132552829970998-prime-craftwars","slug":"132552829970998-prime-craftwars","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/8bc98fc4aa0601c10e1757a61f6efce0e63933a1706213c7f95eb3817270e0e3.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-af31d983ad3b7297c0bbc7f12450d923/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":490909,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-04-06T17:59:00.540Z","creator":{"name":"Hope Of Craftwars","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Prime-Craftwars-PCW-Kill-All-34465","_id":"67f2c0e4a4833d6785e38f02","title":"PCW Kill All","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c7899f","gameId":132552829970998,"name":"Prime Craftwars","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":132552829970998},"features":"Kill All Mobs (Must be holding out any weapon in order to work)\n\nNote: It may not work against some bosses but it mostly works against everything.\n\n^ oh ya btw this script was made with chat GPT. i used neutrals script and improved it with chat GPT so the script does way more damage and supports more bosses/mobs so if you want to improve it yourself, feel free to do so! just check the github source in the script and the raw script will be there.\n\ncredits to neutral for making his script public woohooooooooooo","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/travis358/pcw-script/refs/heads/main/kill%20all%20mobs\"))()","owner":{"_id":"62ad40ebd13c0628e07a4235","username":"virtue","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/8954bc0cfb51b2b365a9ffabd07916d07133d1ff55622e78de74d7adf912d910.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/62ad40ebd13c0628e07a4235-1771455541036.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"62ad40ebd13c0628e07a4235","profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/8954bc0cfb51b2b365a9ffabd07916d07133d1ff55622e78de74d7adf912d910.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/62ad40ebd13c0628e07a4235-1771455541036.jpg"}},"verified":false,"views":7348,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/251b1075ca6450ab93724607d2017c0b9ec9642b13996030d199e16f8e71fc8d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/132552829970998-1743962340485.webp","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/132552829970998-1743962340485.webp"},"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-04-06T17:59:00.540Z","executes":82,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-15T03:05:49.707Z"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/251b1075ca6450ab93724607d2017c0b9ec9642b13996030d199e16f8e71fc8d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/132552829970998-1743962340485.webp","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/132552829970998-1743962340485.webp"},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67f2c0e4a4833d6785e38f04","editBy":{"_id":"62ad40ebd13c0628e07a4235","username":"virtue","status":"offline","id":"62ad40ebd13c0628e07a4235"},"message":"Enjoy!","createdAt":"2025-04-06T17:59:00.544Z"}],"comments":[]},{"slug":"Prime-Craftwars-pc-kill-all-fixed-27411","_id":"6791008f9c7bd8961a539b6c","title":"pc kill all fixed","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c7899f","gameId":132552829970998,"name":"Prime Craftwars","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":132552829970998},"features":"this is a better one that now works with all melee weapons instead of only some and doesnt require you to type in the weapon you want as it automatically detects the weapon","tags":[],"script":"local game = game\nlocal players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal localPlayer = players.LocalPlayer\nlocal character = localPlayer.Character\nlocal runService = game:GetService(\"RunService\")\nlocal cd = 0\n\nrunService.RenderStepped:Connect(function(delta)\n    character = localPlayer.Character\n    local weapon = character:FindFirstChildWhichIsA(\"Tool\")\n    if cd > 0.005 then\n        for _,v in workspace:GetChildren() do\n            if v:FindFirstChild(\"Humanoid\") and v:FindFirstChild(\"Mob\") and v.Mob.Value == true and v.Humanoid.Health > 0 and not players:FindFirstChild(v.Name) and weapon and weapon:FindFirstChild(\"FEMeleeKitEvents\") then\n                weapon.FEMeleeKitEvents.Attack.Attack_Server:FireServer(v,\"Handle\")\n            elseif v:FindFirstChild(\"Humanoid\") and v:FindFirstChild(\"Mob\") and v.Mob.Value == true and v.Humanoid.Health > 0 and not players:FindFirstChild(v.Name) and weapon and weapon:FindFirstChild(\"RemoteFunction\") then\n                weapon.RemoteFunction:InvokeServer(\"hit\",{v.Humanoid,100000})\n            end\n        end\n        cd = 0\n    end\n    cd += delta\nend)","owner":{"_id":"663f0f8448d95881c33f2023","username":"neutral","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz